0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该查询辖区下的历史不可见比例估计）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>fetch</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>K</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌈</mo><mfrac><mi>K</mi><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌉</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{fetch}(K, \\hat{p}) = \\left\\lceil \\frac{K}{\\max(1-\\hat{p},\\; p_{\\min})} \\right\\rceil, \\quad p_{\\min} = 0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fetch</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌈</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌉</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\min}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是防止 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>→</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p} \\to 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 时召回量发散的保护下界；当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{p} &gt; 0.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span></span></span></span></span> 时更合理的做法是判定「该查询在该辖区结果稀疏」，走显式降级路径（合规替代结果或空态），而不是继续放大召回。选择判据里有一个容易被忽略的项：<strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的估计质量</strong>——自适应超额的效果完全取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是否准确，而它要么来自历史统计（对新查询无估计），要么来自策略快照的覆盖统计（可能滞后于最近的规则发布）；因此在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不可靠时，固定倍数比自适应更稳，预过滤比两者都稳。</p>\n<h3 id=\"可见性位图的表示与更新\">可见性位图的表示与更新</h3><p>召回期闸门的热路径需要在一毫秒内回答「文档 d 对作用域 s 是否可见」，这个查询的数据结构选择直接决定闸门的性能上限。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE doc_visibility (&#10;  doc_id        BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  scope_key     TEXT   NOT NULL,&#10;  state         SMALLINT NOT NULL CHECK (state IN (0,1,2)),&#10;  reason_rule   TEXT,&#10;  effective_from TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to   TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (doc_id, scope_key)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_visibility_scope_state&#10;  ON doc_visibility (scope_key, state)&#10;  WHERE state &lt;&gt; 1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> doc_visibility</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  doc_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scope_key     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason_rule   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (doc_id, scope_key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_visibility_scope_state</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> doc_visibility (scope_key, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>state</code> 取 <code>1=visible</code>、<code>0=blocked</code>、<code>2=conditional_pending</code>。索引只覆盖非可见行，因为可见是绝大多数，把它们排除在外让索引体积与「受限文档数」成正比而非与「全库文档数」成正比。在内存中，这个查询由<strong>作用域分片的位图</strong>承担：每个活跃 <code>scope_key</code> 维护一个 Roaring Bitmap 或压缩位图，<code>blocked</code> 与 <code>conditional</code> 各一份，查询退化为两次位图 <code>contains</code>。位图的更新路径上有两次关键处理决定其体积可控：<strong>归一化</strong>作用域键（避免同语义产生多个键）与<strong>合并</strong>同一批变更（一次批量下架可能对同一作用域键产生数万条变更）。位图必须与策略快照绑定哈希，节点拉取时校验同代——不同代的位图会让「规则说不可见、位图说可见」这种矛盾静默存在。</p>\n<h3 id=\"两段式的完整流程-召回标记与结果后置过滤\">两段式的完整流程：召回标记与结果后置过滤</h3><p>实际的实现是<strong>两段式</strong>：召回期只做「标记」，结果期才做「处置」。拆分的理由是召回期处于最热的路径上，任何复杂判定都会放大候选数倍的请求成本；而结果期只作用于 top-K，可以承担更复杂的动作选择。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  Q[query + 作用域键] --&gt; R[多路召回]&#10;  R --&gt; M1[召回期: 位图 + 阈值快照]&#10;  M1 --&gt; M2[为每个候选写标记: blocked/conditional/clean]&#10;  M2 --&gt; RK[粗排 + 精排]&#10;  RK --&gt; G2[结果期: 按标记选动作]&#10;  G2 --&gt; A1[clean -&gt; pass]&#10;  G2 --&gt; A2[blocked -&gt; suppress + 位次补偿]&#10;  G2 --&gt; A3[conditional -&gt; 查二级判据]&#10;  A3 --&gt; A4[命中 -&gt; annotate/replace_with_notice]&#10;  G2 --&gt; EM[埋点: 命中规则/闸门/位次]&#10;  EM --&gt; O[结果组装]\">graph TD\n  Q[query + 作用域键] --&gt; R[多路召回]\n  R --&gt; M1[召回期: 位图 + 阈值快照]\n  M1 --&gt; M2[为每个候选写标记: blocked/conditional/clean]\n  M2 --&gt; RK[粗排 + 精排]\n  RK --&gt; G2[结果期: 按标记选动作]\n  G2 --&gt; A1[clean -&gt; pass]\n  G2 --&gt; A2[blocked -&gt; suppress + 位次补偿]\n  G2 --&gt; A3[conditional -&gt; 查二级判据]\n  A3 --&gt; A4[命中 -&gt; annotate/replace_with_notice]\n  G2 --&gt; EM[埋点: 命中规则/闸门/位次]\n  EM --&gt; O[结果组装]</pre><p>两段式带来两个好处：<strong>标记与动作解耦</strong>——召回期只需回答「这个候选属于哪一类」（位图常数时间），而「归类为 blocked 之后该下架还是加标注」需要读策略快照、可能触发互斥组裁决，放在结果期只有 K 次；<strong>埋点集中</strong>——所有动作决策发生在同一位置，命中埋点只写一次，不会出现「某一路召回忘了上报」。标记必须是一个极小的枚举，因为它在候选数量级上被读写：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;values&quot;: { &quot;0&quot;: &quot;clean&quot;, &quot;1&quot;: &quot;blocked&quot;, &quot;2&quot;: &quot;conditional&quot;, &quot;3&quot;: &quot;notice_bound&quot; },&#10;  &quot;source_bits&quot;: { &quot;bit0&quot;: &quot;scope_bitmap&quot;, &quot;bit1&quot;: &quot;term_dfa&quot;, &quot;bit2&quot;: &quot;category_index&quot;, &quot;bit3&quot;: &quot;takedown_feed&quot; },&#10;  &quot;reset_rule&quot;: &quot;每请求重新计算，不跨请求复用&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"values\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"clean\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"blocked\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"conditional\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"notice_bound\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"source_bits\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"bit0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"scope_bitmap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"bit1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"term_dfa\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"bit2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"category_index\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"bit3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"takedown_feed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"reset_rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"每请求重新计算，不跨请求复用\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>source_bits</code> 解决一个实际的排障需求：当一条候选被标记为 blocked 时，运维需要立刻知道是哪个结构命中的。<code>reset_rule</code> 是一条容易被违反的约束：标记是<strong>请求级</strong>的，因为同一个文档对不同作用域可能有不同标记；把标记缓存到文档对象上会造成跨作用域污染。</p>\n<p>结果期的动作选择则需要一份可配置判据，把「标记 + 作用域 + 上下文」映射到具体动作；它本身必须是策略的一部分（可版本化、可灰度），而不是硬编码在组装层。其中 <code>position_policy</code> 把位次语义变成显式配置：站内搜索用 <code>substitute</code>（补位并记录原始位次），开放 API 用 <code>drop</code>（下游是程序，补位会造成分页错位），更正绑定用 <code>in_place</code>（必须保留原位次）。三者的差异不是风格差异而是<strong>消费方语义差异</strong>，写在同一张决策表里可以让「为什么开放 API 不补位」有一个可查的答案。</p>\n<h3 id=\"命中埋点与性能预算\">命中埋点与性能预算</h3><p>埋点既是这套机制的观测面，也是申诉与监管问询的原始数据；字段设计原则是<strong>能定位到规则与作用域，但不记录用户可识别信息</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>是否必需</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>request_fingerprint</code></td>\n<td>关联同一次请求的多个命中</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>gate</code></td>\n<td><code>recall</code> / <code>result</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>hit_rule_id</code></td>\n<td>定位规则</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>snapshot_id</code></td>\n<td>复现当时的策略版本</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>scope_key</code></td>\n<td>作用域分区</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>mark</code> / <code>action</code></td>\n<td>标记与最终动作</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>original_position</code></td>\n<td>位次补偿与排名评估去污染</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>source_bits</code></td>\n<td>排障：哪个结构命中</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>exemption_id</code></td>\n<td>命中豁免时的依据引用</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>snapshot_id</code> 是最容易被省掉、后果最严重的一列：没有它，一条三个月前的命中记录无法复现——规则可能已改了三版，而记录里只有 <code>hit_rule_id</code>。这也是 <a href=\"../evidence-appeal-report/decision-evidence-chain\">过滤判定证据链</a> 里「引用快照而非复制快照」在埋点层面的落点。两条实施规则同样重要：<strong>埋点必须异步</strong>（放进同步路径会让延迟随命中数线性增长）；<strong>补位候选不得重新打分</strong>（正确做法是按既定顺序取下一个可用候选，其分数保持原值并在日志里标注 <code>substituted</code>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排序后闸门-为什么它必须存在且必须窄\">排序后闸门：为什么它必须存在且必须窄</h2><p>结果期闸门作用于已排好序的 top-K，是整条链路上延迟最敏感的位置。所以它的职责必须被限定为<strong>只处理其他位置处理不了的情况</strong>：<strong>秒级紧急下架</strong>（写侧重建索引来不及、召回期位图重分发也来不及，而结果期可以直接用一个几百到几千 ID 的内存哈希集立即生效）；<strong>跨路召回的最终一致性</strong>（多路召回源中任何一路的可见性条件都可能有遗漏，结果期是唯一的汇聚点）；<strong>可解释性锚点</strong>（给用户和申诉系统一个明确的「这条结果被哪个闸门撤掉」的落点）。这三类的共同线是<strong>等待的代价高于立即处置的代价</strong>；把这条线作为准入门槛，可以防止结果期闸门被塞进本可以在上游解决的判定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"紧急拦截集合的结构与生命周期\">紧急拦截集合的结构与生命周期</h3><p>结果期闸门之所以能秒级生效，靠的是一个人为很小的内存集合；它的结构比规模更重要，因为一条紧急指令往往携带不止一个目标 ID，还携带生效窗口与来源引用。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;order_id&quot;: &quot;TD-2026-0927-0041&quot;,&#10;  &quot;issued_by&quot;: &quot;regulator-notice&quot;,&#10;  &quot;scope_keys&quot;: [&quot;ID:id-ID:web:adult&quot;, &quot;ID:id-ID:app:adult&quot;],&#10;  &quot;targets&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;doc&quot;, &quot;id&quot;: 77120934 },&#10;    { &quot;kind&quot;: &quot;seller&quot;, &quot;id&quot;: &quot;S-90231&quot;, &quot;expand&quot;: &quot;all_docs&quot; }&#10;  ],&#10;  &quot;action&quot;: &quot;suppress&quot;,&#10;  &quot;evidence_ref&quot;: &quot;REG-NOTICE-2026-1140&quot;,&#10;  &quot;propagate_to&quot;: [&quot;realtime_feed&quot;, &quot;visibility_bitmap&quot;, &quot;index_purge_queue&quot;]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"TD-2026-0927-0041\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"issued_by\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"regulator-notice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"scope_keys\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ID:id-ID:web:adult\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ID:id-ID:app:adult\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"targets\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"doc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">77120934</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"seller\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"S-90231\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"expand\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"all_docs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"suppress\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"evidence_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"REG-NOTICE-2026-1140\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"propagate_to\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"realtime_feed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"visibility_bitmap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"index_purge_queue\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>expand</code> 与 <code>propagate_to</code> 是最需要设计的两处。<code>expand: all_docs</code> 意味着指令对象是卖家而不是单条文档，集合必须在加载时展开——但展开是一次数据库查询，若放在请求路径上，秒级生效的前提就没了；正确做法是在指令<strong>进入内存集合时</strong>展开一次并标记为「已展开」。<code>propagate_to</code> 把「这条指令需要触发哪些后续动作」显式列出，避免「结果期拦住了但索引没清、第二天索引重建后又漏出来」这种时序漏洞——紧急指令在结果期生效的同时必须排入正式通道，否则结果期集合一旦因重启而清空，被拦的内容会重新出现。紧急集合的容量必须有硬上限：超过 100 万条时<strong>拒绝进入紧急集合</strong>，必须转为召回期位图与写侧清除。</p>\n<h3 id=\"位次补偿与排名稳定性\">位次补偿与排名稳定性</h3><p>当结果期闸门撤掉一条结果时，后续结果的相对位次会变化。对普通搜索这可以接受，但对已用个性化模型排序、且下游有曝光归因与广告计价的链路，位次跳变会造成数据噪声。一个实用的折中是<strong>占位补偿</strong>：把被撤掉的位置记为「不可用」，从后续候选中取一条补上，但在日志里记录 <code>original_position</code> 与 <code>substituted</code> 标记，让归因分析可以区分「用户在第 3 位点击」的两种含义——原本就在第 3 位的，和因为前面被撤而上升到第 3 位的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多路召回下的一致性\">多路召回下的一致性</h2><p>工程上有两种保证方式。<strong>集中式</strong>：所有召回路的输出在融合前统一过一次可见性过滤，一致性由单点保证，但融合前的候选集通常很大（数千条），逐条判定成本高。<strong>分布式</strong>：每一路自己带可见性条件，融合后由结果期闸门兜底，优点是并行、无额外汇聚开销，缺点是依赖每一路的实现正确。各路的失效模式：倒排路的过滤子句可能被优化器改写后失效；向量路索引内不含位图，只能后过滤；图路在多跳展开中可能漏掉中间节点判定；推荐路的特征快照可能滞后于下架指令。三种组合里，「分布式 + 融合后兜底」是默认选择：它的一致性强度在 top-K 内是强保证，额外延迟可忽略，而集中式与纯分布式分别代价过高与保证过弱。这个选择的隐含前提是「融合后的 top-K 就是用户能看到的全部」；只要这个前提成立，兜底校验就等价于集中式过滤，而成本只有后者的一小部分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"兜底校验的实现约束\">兜底校验的实现约束</h3><p>兜底校验的代码只有几行，但它必须满足三条约束才能起到兜底作用：<strong>必须独立于各路的过滤逻辑</strong>（若复用各路的过滤函数，该函数的一个 bug 会同时让各路和兜底失效；兜底必须走一条完全独立的查询路径，两套实现的失效模式才不相关）；<strong>必须对 top-K 的每一项都执行</strong>，不允许抽样；<strong>兜底命中必须独立告警</strong>（兜底生效说明某一路的实现有缺陷，这是实现级告警而不是业务告警，混在正常过滤指标里会被淹没在流量中）。兜底本身不产生新的合规能力，它产生的是一份「哪一路漏了实现」的证据，而这份证据只有在被独立告警时才有人处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三个闸门位置互补而非替代：写侧管结构性不可售，召回期管有条件的可见性，结果期管突发与兜底。</li>\n<li>后过滤与预过滤的判据是不可见比例；自适应超额召回需要下界保护，其效果取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的估计质量。</li>\n<li>可见性表与位图只索引少数派（受限行），让结构体积与受限规模成正比。</li>\n<li>两段式解耦标记与动作并集中埋点；标记是请求级的；埋点必须带 <code>snapshot_id</code>、必须异步，补位候选不得重新打分。</li>\n<li>结果期闸门必须支持完整动作阶梯，位次补偿记录 <code>original_position</code>；紧急集合有容量上限，超限即转正式通道。</li>\n<li>多路召回采用「各路自带条件 + 融合后 top-K 兜底」，兜底必须独立实现、不抽样、独立告警。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>文本与结构化属性之外，还有一大部分违规只在图片与视频里可见，这部分判定由独立的机审链路承担，见 <a href=\"multimodal-auto-moderation\">图文/视频自动机审</a>；闸门带来的延迟如何被约束在预算内、以及预算不够时按什么顺序降级，见 <a href=\"filter-latency-fallback\">过滤延迟与降级兜底</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"召回期与结果期过滤闸门","id":"召回期与结果期过滤闸门"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三个闸门位置各自的账","id":"核心概念-三个闸门位置各自的账"},{"level":3,"text":"为新规则选择闸门位置","id":"为新规则选择闸门位置"},{"level":3,"text":"召回期闸门的两种实现：后过滤与预过滤","id":"召回期闸门的两种实现-后过滤与预过滤"},{"level":3,"text":"可见性位图的表示与更新","id":"可见性位图的表示与更新"},{"level":3,"text":"两段式的完整流程：召回标记与结果后置过滤","id":"两段式的完整流程-召回标记与结果后置过滤"},{"level":3,"text":"命中埋点与性能预算","id":"命中埋点与性能预算"},{"level":2,"text":"排序后闸门：为什么它必须存在且必须窄","id":"排序后闸门-为什么它必须存在且必须窄"},{"level":3,"text":"紧急拦截集合的结构与生命周期","id":"紧急拦截集合的结构与生命周期"},{"level":3,"text":"位次补偿与排名稳定性","id":"位次补偿与排名稳定性"},{"level":2,"text":"多路召回下的一致性","id":"多路召回下的一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"兜底校验的实现约束","id":"兜底校验的实现约束"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"策略版本化与下发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-content-compliance-filter/compliance-policy-model/policy-version-distribution"},"next":{"title":"图文/视频自动机审","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/search-content-compliance-filter/serving-filter-gate/multimodal-auto-moderation"}}